# The entry points of the estimator World with AP_AHRS (ardupilot/translate_estimator.sh, --use @estimator.use; README.md
# "Phase 3: AP_AHRS in the estimator World, the full estimation replay"): ardupilot/estimation.use's (the sensor front
# ends', NavEKF3's, the scheduler stand-in's, the per-core getters the probe reads) and ardupilot/ahrs.use's (what the
# vehicle calls on AP_AHRS and what the --est probe reads of it), and AP_Baro::get_baro_drift_offset (the probe's `bgnd`).
